{"id":593530,"shortDescription":"Experimental approach to 2d artillery genre: everything is realistically destructible, because the game world is a physics simulation. There are no sprites in the game. All you see is made of dynamically simulated matter, and thus can be destroyed. This innovative approach opens the new layer of physics based gameplay features.","developers":["Zolden Games"],"publishers":["Zolden Games"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","JcJ","JcJ a pantalla (com)partida","Pantalla partida/compartida","Remote Play Together","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"11 DIC 2017","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1527024952","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_4d8fd68685a6254f198ba091a4a024348f0d1850.600x338.jpg?t=1527024952","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_4d8fd68685a6254f198ba091a4a024348f0d1850.1920x1080.jpg?t=1527024952"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_c355d8993b3cea1a38d1912f2bf903324605c416.600x338.jpg?t=1527024952","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_c355d8993b3cea1a38d1912f2bf903324605c416.1920x1080.jpg?t=1527024952"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_cb886c18634f0703ef50fd5860f94a20c326d91d.600x338.jpg?t=1527024952","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_cb886c18634f0703ef50fd5860f94a20c326d91d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1527024952"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_a189a0357f21a0c1d5976a52eb43553a85f8c1e6.600x338.jpg?t=1527024952","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593530/ss_a189a0357f21a0c1d5976a52eb43553a85f8c1e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1527024952"},{"thumb":"https://shared